  "description": "A crushing defeat in middle school drove Gang-Hwi away from basketball. Even as a freshman at Jeon-gwang High, famous for its explosive run-and-gun style, he wants nothing to do with the game. Instead, he channels his competitive drive into one-upping Ilrok, his towering freshman rival. But when their fierce rivalry leads to a one-on-one on the basketball court, Gang-Hwi’s spectacular ankle breaker changes everything, with the varsity coach calling him the missing piece for a national championship run. Can the undersized speedster be the key to championship glory? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
